cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ADMET Generation Benchmark"
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - alias: Nudge92
repository-code: "https://github.com/Nudge92/admet-generation-benchmark"
abstract: >-
  A controlled benchmark of five model generations (rule-based, classical ML,
  GNN, 3D, foundation models) across 36 ADMET endpoints (18 toxicity,
  18 ADME) under identical splits and identical metrics, with adversarial
  verification and a full record of eight self-corrections.
keywords:
  - ADMET
  - molecular property prediction
  - benchmark
  - data leakage
  - graph neural networks
  - QSAR
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-07-26
